        "file": "winter-lys/winter3.ly",
        "old": "#(override-auto-beam-setting '(end 1 32 3 8 )  1 8)\n#(override-auto-beam-setting '(end 1 32 3 8 )  2 8)",
        "new": "\\set Timing.beamExceptions = #'((end . ((1/8 . (3)) (1/32 . (4 4 4)))))",
        "basis": "At source mark N, replace removed automatic-beam Scheme calls with their exact rhythmic intent: 32nd-note beams end at 1/8 and 2/8 in 3/8, hence groups 4+4+4. Retain the default whole-bar eighth-note exception. Only a disposable derivative changes, behind full published MIDI pitch/onset multiset proof."
      },
      {
        "file": "winter-lys/winter3a.ly",
