        "new": "\\set Timing.beamExceptions = #'((end . ((1/8 . (3)) (1/32 . (4 4 4)))))",
        "basis": "Preserve violin I’s source mark-N 32nd-note beaming boundaries at each eighth of the 3/8 bar using modern 4+4+4 beamExceptions; pitches, note order and durations are unchanged."
